      "id": "sandy-beach-2026-11-01-leonna-banzuela",
      "slug": "sandy-beach-2026-11-01-leonna-banzuela",
      "placeId": "sandy-beach-auckland",
      "authorId": "leonna-banzuela",
      "title": "A nice day at Sandy Beach",
      "summary": "A lovely Auckland coast visit, inviting water, and one important thing left at home.",
      "bodyMarkdown": "Sandy Beach was a lovely place to slow down and enjoy the Auckland coast. The water looked so inviting that I really wanted to go for a swim. Unfortunately, I had not brought my swimsuit, so I could not get in. I still had a nice time taking in the view and would happily return better prepared.",
      "visitDate": "2026-11-01",
      "authorRating": 4,
      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "tip-01",
          "perspective": "subjective",
          "text": "Bring a swimsuit if you think you might want to get in the water."
        }
      ],
